---
title: Channel placeholder
style: |
  /* The drag placeholder ([[ui/app/sidebar/index.md]], Pinning and
     reordering): while a row is carried, a tint in the row's shape holds the
     slot release will fill. Every row is one control line, so the slot's
     height is the sum the row states — line, padding, border — and the
     width is the slot's own, taken in flow. */
  .channel-placeholder {
    display: block;
    height: calc(var(--line-control) + 2 * var(--space-4) + 2 * 1px);
    border-radius: var(--control-radius);
    background: var(--drag-placeholder-background);
  }
---
<span class="channel-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span>
